#: ../../pipeline.md:230
msgid ""
"**Script:** [`A3_process.py`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group"
"/OSTRAM-LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/A3_process.py)"
msgstr ""
"**Script:** [`A3_process.py`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group"
"/OSTRAM-LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/A3_process.py)"

#: ../../pipeline.md:232
msgid ""
"An orchestrator that applies a set of post-A1/A2 calibration rules to "
"each scenario's `A-O_Parametrization.xlsx`. For every scenario folder "
"under `A1_Outputs/A1_Outputs_<scenario>/` it runs three per-scenario "
"steps in order, followed by one global harmonisation pass:"
msgstr ""
"Un orquestador que aplica un conjunto de reglas de calibración "
"posteriores a A1/A2 al `A-O_Parametrization.xlsx` de cada escenario. Para"
" cada carpeta de escenario bajo `A1_Outputs/A1_Outputs_<scenario>/` "
"ejecuta tres pasos por escenario en orden, seguidos de un paso global de "
"armonización:"

#: ../../pipeline.md:234
msgid ""
"**Lid rule** ([`add_max_cap_investment_lid_rule.py`](https://github.com"
"/Climate-Lead-Group/OSTRAM-"
"LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/A3_process/rules_scripts/add_max_cap_investment_lid_rule.py)):"
" fills `TotalAnnualMaxCapacityInvestment` placeholders with calibrated "
"lid (top) values, i.e. upper bounds on annual capacity investment, "
"configured in [`lid_rule.yaml`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group"
"/OSTRAM-LAC/blob/main/inputs/config/A3_process/lid_rule.yaml)."
msgstr ""
"**Regla de tope (lid)** "
"([`add_max_cap_investment_lid_rule.py`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-"
"Group/OSTRAM-"
"LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/A3_process/rules_scripts/add_max_cap_investment_lid_rule.py)):"
" llena los marcadores de posición de `TotalAnnualMaxCapacityInvestment` "
"con valores de tope calibrados, es decir, cotas superiores de la "
"inversión anual en capacidad, configurados en "
"[`lid_rule.yaml`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group/OSTRAM-"
"LAC/blob/main/inputs/config/A3_process/lid_rule.yaml)."

#: ../../pipeline.md:235
msgid ""
"**Extend lower limits** ([`extend_lowerlimits_pwr.py`](https://github.com"
"/Climate-Lead-Group/OSTRAM-"
"LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/A3_process/rules_scripts/extend_lowerlimits_pwr.py)):"
" extends the 2024 value of `TotalTechnologyAnnualActivityLowerLimit` flat"
" through 2050 in the `Secondary Techs` sheet, so the calibration floor "
"does not expire. It runs only for the scenarios listed under "
"`lowerlimit_scenarios` in [`lid_rule.yaml`](https://github.com/Climate-"
"Lead-Group/OSTRAM-LAC/blob/main/inputs/config/A3_process/lid_rule.yaml), "
"and each entry sets which PWR technology types receive the floor: `all`, "
"a group defined in `lowerlimit_tech_groups`, or a list of type codes. The"
" shipped entry is `renewable` for BAU, INV, OPT and VGB, so the floor is "
"imposed on renewable generation only (BIO, GEO, CSP, SPV, HYD, WAS, WAV, "
"WON, WOF)."
msgstr ""
"**Extender límites inferiores** "
"([`extend_lowerlimits_pwr.py`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group"
"/OSTRAM-"
"LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/A3_process/rules_scripts/extend_lowerlimits_pwr.py)):"
" extiende el valor de 2024 de `TotalTechnologyAnnualActivityLowerLimit` "
"de forma constante hasta 2050 en la hoja `Secondary Techs`, para que el "
"piso de calibración no expire. Solo se ejecuta para los escenarios "
"listados bajo `lowerlimit_scenarios` en "
"[`lid_rule.yaml`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group/OSTRAM-"
"LAC/blob/main/inputs/config/A3_process/lid_rule.yaml), y cada entrada "
"fija a qué tipos de tecnologías PWR se aplica el piso: `all`, un grupo "
"definido en `lowerlimit_tech_groups` o una lista de códigos de tipo. La "
"entrada de fábrica es `renewable` para BAU, INV, OPT y VGB, de modo que "
"el piso se impone solo a la generación renovable (BIO, GEO, CSP, SPV, "
"HYD, WAS, WAV, WON, WOF)."

#: ../../pipeline.md:236
msgid ""
"**Pre-solver validation**: runs `B1b_Pre_solver_validation.py --auto-fix-"
"all` to reconcile any residual inconsistencies. It is the same validator "
"that B1 runs at startup; see [Pre-solver validation (B1b)](#pre-solver-"
"validation-b1b) under Stage B1."
msgstr ""
"**Validación previa al solver**: ejecuta `B1b_Pre_solver_validation.py "
"--auto-fix-all` para conciliar cualquier inconsistencia residual. Es el "
"mismo validador que B1 ejecuta al arrancar; ver [Validación previa al "
"solver (B1b)](#pre-solver-validation-b1b) bajo la Etapa B1."

#: ../../pipeline.md:237
msgid ""
"**Historical sync to BAU (global, after all scenarios)**: for every "
"scenario listed under `historical_sync_through` in "
"[`lid_rule.yaml`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group/OSTRAM-"
"LAC/blob/main/inputs/config/A3_process/lid_rule.yaml), runs "
"[`sync_historical_from_bau.py`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group"
"/OSTRAM-LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/sync_historical_from_bau.py) "
"`--apply --scenarios <S> --years 2023,…,<through_year>`. It copies the "
"year cells 2023..`<through_year>` from the current BAU workbook into the "
"target scenario so that all scenarios share the same historical/near-term"
" values (shipped: INV 2030, OPT 2026, VGB 2030). Two per-scenario "
"refinements are forwarded from the same YAML: "
"`historical_sync_protect_from_2026` (parameters passed as `--protect-"
"params`, which keep the scenario's own values for years ≥ 2027; shipped "
"for VGB: `TotalTechnologyAnnualActivityLowerLimit`, "
"`TotalAnnualMinCapacityInvestment`, `TotalAnnualMaxCapacityInvestment`) "
"and `historical_sync_tx_follow_bau` (scenarios passed `--no-protect-tx`, "
"whose transmission `TotalAnnualMaxCapacityInvestment` is synced to BAU "
"across the whole window; shipped: OPT). BAU is always the source and "
"never a target. The sync aborts on any structural mismatch between "
"workbooks (row order, sheet names), which stops A3 with a non-zero exit."
msgstr ""
"**Sincronización histórica con BAU (global, después de todos los "
"escenarios)**: para cada escenario listado bajo `historical_sync_through`"
" en [`lid_rule.yaml`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group/OSTRAM-"
"LAC/blob/main/inputs/config/A3_process/lid_rule.yaml), ejecuta "
"[`sync_historical_from_bau.py`](https://github.com/Climate-Lead-Group"
"/OSTRAM-LAC/blob/main/scripts/pipeline/sync_historical_from_bau.py) "
"`--apply --scenarios <S> --years 2023,…,<through_year>`. Copia las celdas"
" de los años 2023..`<through_year>` desde el libro BAU actual hacia el "
"escenario objetivo, de modo que todos los escenarios compartan los mismos"
" valores históricos/de corto plazo (de fábrica: INV 2030, OPT 2026, VGB "
"2030). Se reenvían dos refinamientos por escenario desde el mismo YAML: "
"`historical_sync_protect_from_2026` (parámetros pasados como `--protect-"
"params`, que conservan los valores propios del escenario para años ≥ "
"2027; de fábrica para VGB: `TotalTechnologyAnnualActivityLowerLimit`, "
"`TotalAnnualMinCapacityInvestment`, `TotalAnnualMaxCapacityInvestment`) e"
" `historical_sync_tx_follow_bau` (escenarios a los que se pasa `--no-"
"protect-tx`, cuyo `TotalAnnualMaxCapacityInvestment` de transmisión se "
"sincroniza con BAU en toda la ventana; de fábrica: OPT). BAU siempre es "
"la fuente y nunca un objetivo. La sincronización se aborta ante cualquier"
" discrepancia estructural entre libros (orden de filas, nombres de "
"hojas), lo que detiene A3 con una salida distinta de cero."

